# 🤖 AI Agents Repository

Welcome to **AI Agents**, a collection of powerful, production-ready automations built using tools like **n8n**, **OpenAI**, **Cloudinary**, **Meta Graph API**, and other modern automation frameworks.

This repository serves as a centralized hub for all my AI-powered automation projects — from social media content creation to workflow orchestration and data handling.

---

## 🚀 About This Repository

The **AI Agents** repo contains multiple automation workflows designed to:

* Replace repetitive digital tasks
* Generate content automatically
* Connect with external APIs
* Perform intelligent decision-making
* Handle media, text, and data transformations

Each agent is built to be modular, scalable, and easy to deploy.

---

