## ▶️ How to Use the Projects

1. Clone the repository
2. Open n8n
3. Import the workflow JSON file
4. Add your API keys (OpenAI, Cloudinary, Facebook, etc.)
5. Run the workflow once to test
6. Turn it ON to automate

Each project folder contains setup instructions.
